try>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYAWAKI, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SURGE MIYAWAKI CO., LTD</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIYAWAKI YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYAWAKI, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>When preparing ear marks used by being attached to ears of livestock for identification of livestock, multiple-digit livestock registration number (CN) is printed on at least one face of each ear mark and a farm number (FN) in least necessary digits according to a desired number for ease of livestock identification in each farm is magnified and printed.  The magnified farm number (FN), which is printed by being extracted from a random part of the relative livestock registration number (CN), can be generated efficiently from the livestock registration number.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La préparation de marques distinctives qu'on fixe aux oreilles du bétail afin d'identifier les animaux, consiste à imprimer un numéro d'enregistrement (CN) comportant des chiffres multiples sur au moins une face de chaque marque d'oreille et un numéro de ferme (FN) comportant moins de chiffres et à produire ces marques selon l'impression et l'agrandissement désirés afin d'obtenir un nombre de marques facilitant l'identification du bétail dans chaque ferme. Le numéro de ferme (FN) agrandi, imprimé par extraction d'une partie aléatoire du numéro relatif d'enregistrement du bétail, peut être obtenu sans difficultés à partir de ce dernier numéro.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>